"height":38},{"text":"트래픽","x":791,"y":1637,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":909,"y":1637,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"스토리지","x":956,"y":1638,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"용량이","x":1107,"y":1638,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"엄청나게","x":1225,"y":1638,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"필요함","x":1373,"y":1638,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"을 의미한다. 예를 들어 지속시간이 67분인 단일 2 Mpbs 비디오는 1 GByte의 스토리","words":[{"text":"을","x":175,"y":1698,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"의미한다.","x":222,"y":1698,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":375,"y":1697,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"들어","x":452,"y":1698,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"지속시간이","x":533,"y":1697,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"67분인","x":711,"y":1697,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"단일","x":830,"y":1698,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"2","x":911,"y":1702,"width":18,"height":29},{"text":"Mpbs","x":943,"y":1702,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"비디오는","x":1047,"y":1698,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"1","x":1197,"y":1702,"width":11,"height":28},{"text":"GByte의","x":1225,"y":1697,"width":130,"height":41},{"text":"스토리","x":1372,"y":1698,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"지 및 트래픽을 소비한다. 지금까지 스트리밍 비디오에서 가장 중요한 성능 척도는 평","words":[{"text":"지","x":178,"y":1759,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":224,"y":1759,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"트래픽을","x":267,"y":1757,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"소비한다.","x":412,"y":1758,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"지금까지","x":569,"y":1758,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"스트리밍","x":716,"y":1758,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"비디오에서","x":866,"y":1758,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"가장","x":1051,"y":1759,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"중요한","x":1130,"y":1758,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"성능","x":1247,"y":1757,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"척도는","x":1328,"y":1758,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"평","x":1441,"y":1759,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"균 종단간(end-to-end) 처리량이다. 연속재생을 제공하기 위해, 네트워크는 압축된 비","words":[{"text":"균","x":176,"y":1822,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"종단간(end-to-end)","x":222,"y":1819,"width":287,"height":39},{"text":"처리량이다.","x":527,"y":1819,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"연속재생을","x":720,"y":1818,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"제공하기","x":902,"y":1819,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"위해,","x":1053,"y":1819,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크는","x":1145,"y":1818,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"압축된","x":1327,"y":1818,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"비","x":1442,"y":1818,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"디오의 전송률 이상의 스트리밍 애플리케이션에 대한 평균 처리량을 제공해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"디오의","x":178,"y":1880,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"전송률","x":289,"y":1879,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"이상의","x":399,"y":1878,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"스트리밍","x":510,"y":1880,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션에","x":657,"y":1879,"width":233,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":907,"y":1879,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"평균","x":988,"y":1880,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"처리량을","x":1069,"y":1879,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"제공해야","x":1215,"y":1878,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1359,"y":1879,"width":74,"height":37}]},{"text":"또한 압축을 사용하여 동일한 비디오를 여러 버전의 품질로 만들 수 있다. 예를 들","words":[{"text":"또한","x":241,"y":1941,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"압축을","x":320,"y":1940,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"사용하여","x":430,"y":1939,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"동일한","x":576,"y":1940,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"비디오를","x":691,"y":1940,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"여러","x":840,"y":1940,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"버전의","x":920,"y":1940,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"품질로","x":1033,"y":1940,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"만들","x":1148,"y":1939,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1226,"y":1939,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1275,"y":1940,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":1363,"y":1940,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"들","x":1445,"y":1941,"width":24,"height":35}]},{"text":"어 300 kbps, 1 Mpbs 및 3 Mbps의 속도로 동일한 비디오의 세 가지 버전을 만들 때","words":[{"text":"어","x":178,"y":2002,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"300","x":223,"y":2006,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"kbps,","x":292,"y":2006,"width":80,"height":36},{"text":"1","x":390,"y":2005,"width":12,"height":28},{"text":"Mpbs","x":419,"y":2005,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"및","x":522,"y":2000,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"3","x":568,"y":2005,"width":17,"height":29},{"text":"Mbps의","x":601,"y":2001,"width":118,"height":42},{"text":"속도로","x":736,"y":2002,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"동일한","x":852,"y":2001,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"비디오의","x":971,"y":2001,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"세","x":1118,"y":2000,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"가지","x":1166,"y":2000,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"버전을","x":1248,"y":2000,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"만들","x":1362,"y":2000,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1442,"y":2001,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"압축을 사용할 수 있다. 싸우자는 현재 사\u0026 가능한 대역폭을 선택하여 보고 싶은 버전","words":[{"text":"압축을","x":178,"y":2063,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"사용할","x":288,"y":2061,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":398,"y":2062,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":447,"y":2061,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"싸우자는","x":533,"y":2061,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"현재","x":681,"y":2062,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"사\u0026","x":760,"y":2062,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"가능한","x":841,"y":2062,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"대역폭을","x":957,"y":2062,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"선택하여","x":1104,"y":2062,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"보고","x":1250,"y":2064,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"싶은","x":1331,"y":2062,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"버전","x":1410,"y":2062,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 결정할 수 있다. 초고속 인터넷 연결을 가진 사용자는 3 Mbps 버전을 선택할 수 있","words":[{"text":"을","x":176,"y":2125,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"결정할","x":223,"y":2123,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":332,"y":2123,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":381,"y":2121,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"초고속","x":466,"y":2123,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":